The tests in files named django_*_test.go are ported from the test suite of
Django (https://github.com/django/django), and the assertions of the djangotest
package reproduce the failure messages of django.test. Each ported test names
its source in a comment of the form

    Ported from Django: tests/<file>.py::<Class>.<test>

The files under admin/static/admin are copied from Django's main branch at
commit 5b122da (django/contrib/admin/static/admin), the version the admin
templates follow. The jQuery, Select2 and XRegExp files under
admin/static/admin/js/vendor and admin/static/admin/css/vendor keep the
licenses in their folders.

